OL,3,AIsraeli minister threatens to revoke
OL,4,Afilmmakers' citizenship over Gaza
OL,5,Adocumentary
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsrael's culture minister has called
OL,8,Ffor the Oscar-winning Israeli
OL,9,Fco-directors of Naza, a documentary
OL,10,Fthat accuses the Israeli army of mass
OL,11,Fcivilian killings in Gaza, to be
OL,12,Fstripped of their citizenship over
OL,13,F"treason against the state".
OL,15,FNamed for the Hebrew military acronym
OL,16,Ffor collateral damage, the film speaks
OL,17,Fto 24 unidentified Israeli military and
OL,18,Fintelligence officers who outlined the
OL,19,FAI-powered targeting systems used by
OL,20,Fthe Israeli army to bombard Gaza in the
OL,21,Fwar triggered by the Hamas-led attack
OL,22,Fon 7 October 2023.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
