OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AIsraeli minister threatens to revoke
OL,4,Afilmmakers' citizenship over Gaza
OL,5,Adocumentary
OL,6,
OL,7,FSince then, more than 73,000
OL,8,FPalestinians, including more than
OL,9,F20,000 children, have been killed in
OL,10,Fthe campaign by the Israel Defense
OL,11,FForces (IDF), according to Gaza's
OL,12,FHamas-run health ministry, figures
OL,13,Fconsidered reliable by the UN. About
OL,14,F1,200 people were killed and 251 taken
OL,15,Fhostage during the Hamas attack.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
