CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F168A1789475058
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AIsraeli minister threatens to revoke
OL,4,Afilmmakers' citizenship over Gaza
OL,5,Adocumentary
OL,6,
OL,7,FYuval Abraham and Rachel Szor say their
OL,8,F80-minute documentary "details the
OL,9,Fsystems behind Israel's calculated mass
OL,10,Fkilling of Palestinian civilians in
OL,11,FGaza" during the war, according to its
OL,12,Fofficial synopsis. One of the people
OL,13,Finterviewed says there was the approval
OL,14,Ffor an attack to kill 500 people for
OL,15,F"one human target", an allegation the
OL,16,FIDF said was "completely false".
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
